    "Passer d'une application à l'autre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch between apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pendant que tu règles la taille, le vrai carrousel s'affiche au milieu de l'écran. Apparition : plus court, le carrousel vient plus tôt mais un simple effleurement risque de l'afficher ; plus long, c'est l'inverse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While you adjust the size, the real carousel appears in the middle of the screen. Delay: shorter, the carousel appears sooner but a simple flick may show it; longer, the opposite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petit": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Position": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pousser la souris tout au fond de ce coin affiche la grille ; y revenir la referme. Si macOS utilise déjà ce coin, désactive-le dans Réglages Système > Bureau et Dock > Coins actifs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pushing the pointer all the way into this corner shows the grid; going back there closes it. If macOS already uses this corner, turn it off in System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Hot Corners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
