    "Sens": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direction"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Side est ouvert : c'est lui qui gère les coins actifs, pour que la grille, le Finder, le tiroir et le presse-papiers ne se disputent pas les coins. Choisis le coin de la grille dans Side › Coins actifs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Side is open, so it manages the hot corners: this way the grid, the Finder, the drawer and the clipboard never compete for a corner. Choose the grid's corner in Side › Hot Corners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Square redémarre pour changer de langue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Square restarts to change the language."
