        }
      }
    },
    "Un clic remplit l'écran en restant sur le même bureau ; un second rend à la fenêtre sa taille. Maj + clic ou Option + clic gardent le plein écran d'Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One click fills the screen while staying on the same desktop; a second click restores the window's size. Shift-click or Option-click keeps macOS full screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un effleurement rapide change d'application sans rien afficher. Un geste posé fait apparaître le carrousel, et l'application du centre passe devant quand les doigts se lèvent. Le geste ne s'active que s'il n'y a qu'un seul bureau ; sinon macOS glisse d'un bureau à l'autre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A quick flick switches apps without showing anything. A slower swipe brings up the carousel, and the app in the center comes to the front when you lift your fingers. The gesture only works when there is a single desktop; otherwise macOS swipes between desktops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vers « Vite » : il apparaît plus tôt, mais un simple effleurement risque de l'afficher. Vers « Tard » : l'inverse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toward “Soon”: it appears earlier, but a simple flick may show it. Toward “Late”: the opposite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vite": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "l'application": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "À droite": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Right"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "À gauche": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "À sa première utilisation, ce Dock est une copie de celui de macOS ; ensuite il vit sa vie. Son premier bouton ouvre la liste de toutes les applications : Entrée ajoute au Dock l'application choisie, Suppr l'en retire. Un clic droit sur une icône permet de la retirer du Dock ou de quitter l'application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time you use it, this Dock is a copy of the macOS Dock; after that it has a life of its own. Its first button opens the list of all apps: Return adds the selected app to the Dock, Delete removes it. Right-click an icon to remove it from the Dock or quit the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "À utiliser seulement s'il reste des fenêtres dans un plein écran d'Apple : elles en sortent et remplissent l'écran à la place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use only if some windows are still in macOS full screen: they leave it and fill the screen instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌃ + chiffre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌃ + number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘ + chiffre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘ + number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥ + chiffre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌥ + number"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}